{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119221","id":3625241147,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7YFMo7","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119221","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119221.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119221.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119221","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119221/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119221/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119221/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1defb6f8ae8dce5074196060e2538981cc39f927","number":119221,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Document that `@rpc` takes precedence over `Node.rpc_config()`","user":{"login":"haider0072","id":55896536,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1ODk2NTM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55896536?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072","html_url":"https://github.com/haider0072","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haider0072/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The `Node.rpc_config()` documentation describes the method as if it always sets the RPC configuration for the given method, but that is not what actually happens at runtime. When the same method has both a script-level `@rpc` annotation and a `Node.rpc_config()` call, the script-level configuration wins. This is enforced in `modules/multiplayer/scene_rpc_interface.cpp` (around lines 105 to 117), which consults the script-defined config first and only falls back to the node-level config when no annotation exists.\n\nThis PR adds a second `[b]Note:[/b]` to the existing `rpc_config` description spelling out that precedence rule. It also points readers at `Script.get_rpc_config` and `get_node_rpc_config` so they can inspect each layer independently when debugging mismatches between expected and actual RPC behavior.\n\nNo code is changed, this is a doc-only correction in `doc/classes/Node.xml`.\n\nFixes #118021.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","description":"","color":"ffddff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/